44.                             <p class="mb-1"><strong>Status:</strong> <span class="badge @GetStatusBadge(shipment.Status)">@shipment.Status</span></p>
45.                             <p class="mb-1"><strong>From:</strong> @shipment.Origin</p>
46.                             <p class="mb-1"><strong>To:</strong> @shipment.Destination</p>
47.                             <p class="mb-1"><strong>Recipient:</strong> @(shipment.RecipientName ?? "N/A")</p>
48.                             @if (shipment.EstimatedDeliveryUtc.HasValue)
49.                             {
